cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you cite this specification, please use the information below and also give the section and rule ids you rely on (e.g. 3.3 L1, I7)."
type: software
title: "Mallangable-AI: A Reference Architecture for AI-Driven Malleable Software"
abstract: >-
  Vendor-neutral reference architecture for malleable software driven by AI agents:
  formal model with ten invariants, five-level change-depth hierarchy, an eleven-axis
  design space with a calculator, interval-delegation control with user floor rights,
  a six-plane reference architecture, contract-preserving merges, and a business-model
  coupling matrix. Specification in English (default), Korean (original), Simplified Chinese, Japanese and Spanish, with JSON Schemas and tools.
authors:
  - name: "Mallangable-AI contributors"
version: "0.2.4"
date-released: "2026-11-05"
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - malleable software
  - end-user programming
  - AI agents
  - reference architecture
  - design space
